<title>USA: Lear Corp completes Keiper acquisition.</title>
<headline>Lear Corp completes Keiper acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTHFIELD, Mich. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lear Corp said Thursday it has completed the acquisition of the Keiper Car Seating business from Putsch GmbH &amp; Co KG, KEIPER GmbH &amp; Co and certain of their affiliates.</p>
<p>The purchase price, which included the assumption of debt, was about $260 million.</p>
<p>	 -- ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
